          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP715 Bow River Valley&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out grabbing some Caches and Caps today and this was one of them. Cap was an easy find but is pretty scratched up. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Information will be sent to the C.O. shortly. Thanks,OFTH, for another great discovery &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
